s = '{"arch":"RISC-V64","completionTime":3,"difficulty":"进阶/Advanced","email":"yangzehua.yzh@alibaba-inc.com","firstName":null,"license":["Apache-2.0 license"],"matchedStudentName":null,"nickname":"玄飏","orgId":"6eba80a6-81a9-4999-8c3b-70796665f622","orgProgramId":10,"outputRequirement":[{"title":"","children":[]},{"title":"1. 完成 LoongSuite Pilot 在 Linux riscv64 上的安装与启动适配：安装器可正确识别架构，服务可拉起，`loongsuite-pilot status/info` 等基础运维命令可用。 ","children":[]},{"title":"2. 解决或明确规避关键原生依赖（至少覆盖 `sqlite3`、`zstd-napi`）在 riscv64 上的构建/加载问题，给出可复现步骤与失败降级策略，并保证核心采集主路径可用。  ","children":[]},{"title":"3. 提交可复现的 RISC-V 冒烟验证（安装 → 启动 → 至少一条采集/输出链路）与文档更新（中英文安装/限制/排障），相关代码以 PR 形式合入主仓库。  ","children":[]},{"title":"4. 补充构建/冒烟脚本或 CI 说明，使后续版本可持续验证 riscv64 支持，而不是一次性手工移植。  ","children":[]}],"outputRequirementEN":[{"title":"","children":[]},{"title":"1. Complete install/startup adaptation on Linux riscv64: installer architecture detection works, the service starts, and basic ops commands such as `loongsuite-pilot status/info` are usable.","children":[]},{"title":"2. Resolve or clearly work around critical native dependencies on riscv64 (at least `sqlite3` and `zstd-napi`), with reproducible steps and fallback strategy, keeping the core collection path usable.","children":[]},{"title":"3. Deliver reproducible RISC-V smoke verification (install → start → at least one collect/export path) and docs updates (ZH/EN install, limits, troubleshooting); land code via PRs to the main repository.","children":[]},{"title":"4. Add build/smoke scripts or CI notes so riscv64 support can be continuously verified in later releases, not only as a one-off manual port.","children":[]}],"programCode":"266eb0010","programDesc":"<p></p><p><strong>（1）背景介绍</strong></p><p></p><p>随着 RISC-V 生态在服务器、开发板与国产操作系统（如 openEuler RISC-V）上的快速落地，越来越多研发团队会在 riscv64 环境中使用 AI Coding Agent（Cursor、Claude Code、Codex、Qoder 等）进行日常开发。LoongSuite Pilot 是一个运行在开发者本机的多 Agent 轻量遥测采集平台：可自动发现本机 Agent、部署 Hook/插件、将活动数据归一化为统一 GenAI 事件 Schema，并输出到 JSONL / SLS / HTTP / OTLP Trace。若 Pilot 无法在 RISC-V 上稳定运行，相关团队将缺少统一的本机采集与可观测能力。</p><p></p><p><strong>（2）现有工作</strong></p><p></p><p>当前 Pilot 已具备较完整的采集与运维能力：</p><p></p><p>- 支持多种主流 AI Coding Agent 的发现、部署与采集；</p><p>- 提供安装器、服务管理、版本更新与本地 Dashboard；</p><p>- 核心实现以 TypeScript/Node.js 为主，配套 Bash 安装与发布脚本；</p><p>- 依赖中包含原生模块（如 &#x60;sqlite3&#x60;、&#x60;zstd-napi&#x60;），用于本地会话/Token 数据读取与压缩等能力；</p><p>- 已在常见 x86_64 / aarch64（含 macOS arm64）环境完成日常验证与发布。</p><p></p><p><strong>（3）现有不足</strong></p><p></p><p>- 发布物、安装检测与文档默认面向 x86_64 / aarch64，缺少面向 riscv64 的明确支持声明与验证矩阵；</p><p>- 原生依赖在 riscv64 上可能缺少预编译包，需源码编译或替代方案，当前缺少系统化适配与排障指引；</p><p>- CI/发布流程尚未覆盖 RISC-V 构建、冒烟测试与制品分发；</p><p>- 在 RISC-V Linux 上的 Agent 发现路径、服务拉起、健康检查与升级回滚尚未形成可复现验收标准。</p><p></p><p><strong>（4）希望改进的部分</strong></p><p></p><p>本议题希望完成 Pilot 面向 RISC-V 的端到端适配，重点包括：</p><p></p><p>1. **运行时与原生依赖适配**：确保 Node.js 18+ 环境下核心采集链路可在 riscv64 启动；解决 &#x60;sqlite3&#x60; / &#x60;zstd-napi&#x60; 等原生模块的构建、加载与降级策略。</p><p>2. **安装与运维链路适配**：扩展 &#x60;installer&#x60; / 打包脚本的架构识别（&#x60;uname -m&#x60; / &#x60;process.arch&#x60;），支持 riscv64 安装、状态查看、重启与回滚。</p><p>3. **验证与持续集成**：补充 RISC-V 环境构建与冒烟测试（至少覆盖安装、服务启动、基础采集/输出），沉淀可复现文档。</p><p>4. **文档与发布说明**：在安装指南与发布说明中明确 RISC-V 支持范围、已知限制与排障方法。</p><p></p><p><strong>（5）最终项目实现的愿景</strong></p><p></p><p>学生结项后，LoongSuite Pilot 应能在典型 RISC-V Linux（riscv64）环境中完成「一键安装 → 发现/部署采集能力 → 归一化输出 → 服务运维」闭环；相关改动合入主仓，并留下可持续维护的 CI/文档资产，使后续版本可把 RISC-V 作为一等公民架构持续支持。</p>","programDescEN":"<p>(1) Background</p><p></p><p>As the RISC-V ecosystem expands across servers, development boards, and Linux distributions such as openEuler RISC-V, more engineering teams develop on riscv64 hosts with AI coding agents (Cursor, Claude Code, Codex, Qoder, and others). LoongSuite Pilot is a local multi-agent telemetry collector: it discovers installed agents, deploys hooks/plugins, normalizes activity into a shared GenAI event schema, and exports to JSONL, SLS, HTTP, or OTLP traces. Without reliable RISC-V support, teams on riscv64 lack a unified local collection and observability path.</p><p></p><p>(2) Existing work</p><p></p><p>Pilot already provides a solid collection and operations foundation:</p><p></p><p>- Discovery, deployment, and collection for multiple mainstream AI coding agents;</p><p>- Installer, service management, updater, and a local dashboard;</p><p>- Core implementation in TypeScript/Node.js with Bash packaging/install scripts;</p><p>- Native dependencies such as &#x60;sqlite3&#x60; and &#x60;zstd-napi&#x60; for local session/token reads and compression;</p><p>- Day-to-day validation and releases focused on x86_64 and aarch64 (including macOS arm64).</p><p></p><p>(3) Existing shortcomings</p><p></p><p>- Release artifacts, install checks, and docs assume x86_64/aarch64 and do not declare a verified riscv64 matrix;</p><p>- Native modules may lack prebuilds on riscv64 and require source builds or fallbacks; there is no systematic porting/troubleshooting guide yet;</p><p>- CI/release pipelines do not cover RISC-V build, smoke tests, and artifact distribution;</p><p>- Agent discovery paths, service bootstrap, health checks, and upgrade/rollback on RISC-V Linux lack reproducible acceptance criteria.</p><p></p><p>(4) What we hope to improve</p><p></p><p>This project aims to deliver end-to-end RISC-V support for Pilot:</p><p></p><p>1. **Runtime and native dependency porting**: make the core collection path start on riscv64 under Node.js 18+; resolve build/load/fallback strategies for &#x60;sqlite3&#x60;, &#x60;zstd-napi&#x60;, and similar addons.</p><p>2. **Install and ops path adaptation**: extend installer/packaging architecture detection (&#x60;uname -m&#x60; / &#x60;process.arch&#x60;) for riscv64 install, status, restart, and rollback.</p><p>3. **Verification and CI**: add RISC-V build and smoke tests (install, service start, basic collect/export) with reproducible docs.</p><p>4. **Documentation and release notes**: clearly state RISC-V support scope, known limits, and troubleshooting steps.</p><p></p><p>(5) Vision of the final project implementation</p><p></p><p>After completion, LoongSuite Pilot should complete the loop of “one-command install → discover/deploy collection → normalize/export → operate the service” on a typical RISC-V Linux (riscv64) environment. Changes should land in the main repository with maintainable CI and documentation so RISC-V remains a first-class supported architecture in later releases.</p><p></p>","programHeat":"low","programName":"LoongSuite Pilot 支持 RISC-V 架构","programNameEN":"Add RISC-V Architecture Support for LoongSuite Pilot","programRemark":null,"programRemarkEN":null,"programmingLanguageTag":"[\"Typescript\",\"JavaScript\",\"Shell\",\"C++\"]","repo":["https://github.com/alibaba/loongsuite-pilot"],"supportLanguage":0,"techRequirement":[{"title":"","children":[]},{"title":"1. 熟悉 TypeScript / Node.js（建议 Node.js 18+），能阅读并修改现有 Collector、Installer 与脚本代码。  ","children":[]},{"title":"2. 了解 Linux 多架构基础（`uname -m`、`process.arch`），具备在 riscv64 环境（真机/虚拟机/QEMU）完成编译、安装与排障的能力；有原生模块（node-gyp/prebuild）经验更佳。  ","children":[]},{"title":"3. 具备基本的 Git/GitHub 协作与测试能力：能提交清晰 PR、补充测试或冒烟脚本，并编写中英文技术文档。","children":[]},{"title":"4. 对 AI Coding Agent、可观测性（日志/Trace）或 OpenTelemetry 有兴趣或基础了解者优先。  ","children":[]}],"techRequirementEN":[{"title":"","children":[]},{"title":"1. Familiar with TypeScript/Node.js (Node.js 18+ preferred); able to read and modify the existing collector, installer, and scripts.","children":[]},{"title":"2. Understand Linux multi-arch basics (`uname -m`, `process.arch`) and be able to build/install/troubleshoot on riscv64 (bare metal, VM, or QEMU); experience with native addons (node-gyp/prebuild) is a plus.","children":[]},{"title":"3. Have basic Git/GitHub collaboration and testing skills: clear PRs, tests or smoke scripts, and bilingual technical documentation.","children":[]},{"title":"4. Interest or basic knowledge in AI coding agents, observability (logs/traces), or OpenTelemetry is preferred.","children":[]}],"techTag":"[[\"datas\",\"AI\"],[\"dev\",\"AIOps\"],[\"dev\",\"CI\"],[\"dev\",\"LLMOps\"],[\"os\",\"RISC-V\"]]","activityId":2036,"supervisionExperience":[{"year":2024,"programCode":"246eb0236","programName":"ConfigServer 能力升级 + 体验优化（全栈）","completion":true}],"canApply":true,"isCommitteeSupported":1,"programType":1}'

